     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/slaughter-refuge-2015-08-19#:~:text=%22Gideon%20is%20right%2C%20Tazri%2C%22%20Vorik%20said."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Dying, he hears Gideon argue for retaking Sea Gate, names him Commander-General of the Zendikari, and tells Tazri to support him.",
